@guide A_34_Desolace
@name Desolace (43)
@faction Alliance
@levels 43-43
@zone Desolace
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Desolace, visit 1 of 1 on the Alliance route, levels 43.
@next A_35_Tanaris

travel Desolace
accept 1453 Reclaimers' Business in Desolace [zone=Ironforge] | Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge's Hall of Explorers. Needed for the Reclaimers quests in Desolace.
note From Ironforge fly to Menethil Harbor and take the boat to Auberdine. Fly to Stonetalon Peak if you have it (otherwise Astranaar, then ride west through Stonetalon) and follow the road south into Desolace. Nijel's Point is in the north-east.
fp Nijel's Point
accept 1387 Centaur Bounty | Corporal Melkins.
accept 1382 Strange Alliance
complete 1382 Strange Alliance
accept 1437 Vahlarriel's Search | Vahlarriel Demonslayer.
accept 1385 Brutal Politics | Captain Pentigast. Choose the Magram side: do not also take Strange Alliance.
turnin 1453 Reclaimers' Business in Desolace | Kreldig Ungor.
accept 1458 Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. | Kreldig Ungor.
accept 1454 The Karnitol Shipwreck | Kreldig Ungor.
complete 1458 Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. | Hatefury satyrs at Sargeron, east of Nijel's Point.
turnin 1458 Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.
accept 1459 Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. | Scorpashi in the north and Aged Kodos in the south. Collect the venom as you go.
turnin 1437 Vahlarriel's Search | At the Malem chest by the overturned cart.
accept 1465 Vahlarriel's Search
accept 5741 Sceptre of Light | Azore Aldamort, the tower on the west coast.
accept 6161 Claim Rackmore's Treasure! | Rackmore's Log by the Karnitol wreck.
turnin 1454 The Karnitol Shipwreck | Karnitol's Chest on the wrecked ship.
accept 1455 The Karnitol Shipwreck
complete 6161 Claim Rackmore's Treasure! | Silver Key from Drysnap Crawlers on the shore, Golden Key from Slitherblade Naga.
turnin 6161 Claim Rackmore's Treasure! | Rackmore's Chest on Ranazjar Isle, north-west. Swim across.
turnin 1455 The Karnitol Shipwreck | Back at Nijel's Point.
turnin 1465 Vahlarriel's Search
accept 1456 The Karnitol Shipwreck
accept 1438 Vahlarriel's Search
turnin 1438 Vahlarriel's Search | Dalinda Malem, inside Thunder Axe Fortress.
accept 1439 Search for Tyranis
complete 1439 Search for Tyranis | Tyranis Malem inside the fortress.
complete 5741 Sceptre of Light | Burning Blade Seers in Thunder Axe Fortress; the Sceptre drops from the one at the top of the tower.
turnin 1439 Search for Tyranis
note The next quest, Return to Vahlarriel, is an escort: pick it up only when you are ready to follow the NPC.
accept 1440 Return to Vahlarriel | Escort quest: Dalinda walks you out of the fortress.
complete 1440 Return to Vahlarriel
complete 1459 Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. [obj=1] | Scorpashi Venom from Scorpashi in the north.
turnin 1440 Return to Vahlarriel | Nijel's Point.
complete 1456 The Karnitol Shipwreck | Karnitol's Satchel from Slitherblade Tidehunters on the north-west coast.
turnin 5741 Sceptre of Light | Azore Aldamort.
turnin 1456 The Karnitol Shipwreck | Nijel's Point.
accept 5501 Bone Collector | Bibbly F'utzbuckle at Kormek's Hut.
accept 5561 Kodo Roundup | Smeed Scrabblescrew at the caravan camp.
note The next quest, Gizelton Caravan, is an escort: pick it up only when you are ready to follow the NPC.
accept 5943 Gizelton Caravan
complete 5943 Gizelton Caravan | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
note The next quest, Bodyguard for Hire, is an escort: pick it up only when you are ready to follow the NPC.
accept 5821 Bodyguard for Hire
complete 5821 Bodyguard for Hire | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
note The next quest, Get Me Out of Here!, is an escort: pick it up only when you are ready to follow the NPC.
accept 6132 Get Me Out of Here!
complete 6132 Get Me Out of Here! | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
turnin 5943 Gizelton Caravan
turnin 5821 Bodyguard for Hire
turnin 6132 Get Me Out of Here!
turnin 1382 Strange Alliance
complete 5561 Kodo Roundup | Use the Kodo Kombobulator on Ancient, Aged or Dying Kodos in the Kodo Graveyard and lead them back to Smeed.
complete 5501 Bone Collector | Kodo Bones on the ground in the Kodo Graveyard.
complete 1459 Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. [obj=2] | Aged Kodo Hide from Aged Kodos around the graveyard.
turnin 5561 Kodo Roundup
turnin 1385 Brutal Politics | Warug in the Magram village, east.
accept 1386 Assault on the Kolkar
complete 1386 Assault on the Kolkar | Kolkar village north of the Magram.
complete 1387 Centaur Bounty | Centaur Ears from the same Kolkar.
turnin 1386 Assault on the Kolkar
turnin 5501 Bone Collector | Kormek's Hut.
turnin 1387 Centaur Bounty | Nijel's Point.
turnin 1459 Reagents for Reclaimers Inc.
accept 1466 Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. [optional] | Mannoroc Coven demons; level 38-40 and they hit hard.
accept 261 Down the Scarlet Path | Brother Anton. Needs level 34.
complete 1466 Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. [optional] | Mana Eaters, Nether Maidens and Doomwarder Captains at the Mannoroc Coven.
complete 261 Down the Scarlet Path | Undead Ravagers in the Valley of Bones, far south.
turnin 1466 Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. [optional] | Nijel's Point.
turnin 261 Down the Scarlet Path
accept 7028 Twisted Evils
complete 7028 Twisted Evils
turnin 7028 Twisted Evils
level 43 | Tanaris starts at 43. If you are lower, kill what is around you here (or run a dungeon) until you reach it.
